# Motor-IQ 

Motor-IQ is an automated surveillance camera recognition and analysis system designed for real-time license plate detection and vehicle tracking.

## Key Features
- **Real-time Detection:** High-accuracy license plate recognition via video feeds.
- **Automated Analytics:** Processes vehicle data for smart traffic and security analysis.
- **Scalable Architecture:** Designed for high performance and seamless integration.

## Tech Stack
- **Languages & Frameworks:** Python, OpenCV, YOLO
- **Database:** PostgreSQL / Redis
- **Containerization:** Docker

## Installation & Setup
bash
# Clone the repository
git clone [https://github.com/YourUsername/Motor-IQ.git](https://github.com/YourUsername/Motor-IQ.git)

# Navigate to project directory
cd Motor-IQ

# Run with Docker
docker-compose up --build
